# The two unary operators; each reading fires exactly one rule.
#
#   r1  state=35.0  flags=-1     -35.0 < 0.0  fires `negated`
#                                ~(-1) = 0, not < 0, so `inverted` stays quiet
#   r2  state=-5.0  flags=0      -(-5.0) = 5.0, not < 0, `negated` quiet
#                                ~0 = -1 < 0  fires `inverted`
assert Reading entity_id=r1 state=35.0 flags=-1
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r2 state=-5.0 flags=0
pump
